nodes.body:
@jperezdealgaba Thanks for the review — all three points addressed in `c220f2b`:

- `/abort_requests` moved out of "operational control (generate task)" into a new `--tokens-only` section, with a note that the dev RLHF variant aborts all in-flight requests when `request_ids` is empty.
- Security Implications items 2–3 now lead with the production example (`/scale_elastic_ep`), with dev-only endpoints called out as conditional.

